#. Description of the plugin
#: sh-clone-migration.php
msgid "Complete WordPress website cloning and migration system. Exports an entire site (database + files) into a single portable .wpress archive and restores it on any other WordPress installation. Scheduled backups, optionally stored on your own Google Drive."
msgstr ""

